268
01:52:46.790 --> 01:52:47.540
Temps...

269
01:53:05.980 --> 01:53:07.900
Jésus a dit.

270
01:53:32.940 --> 01:53:34.320
La carrière

271
01:54:31.530 --> 01:54:32.210
Non pas !

272
01:58:14.460 --> 01:58:15.270
Mes mains !
